source_note = "vc115 Moon rework: scripts/moon_height.gd (user-supplied hash craters, 4 layers, 28 m hill radius 140 m, summit clear 6 m) drives terrain; no rocks, no rover, no pebbles in vc115 (pebbles future-only); dark gray regolith albedo ~0.12, procedural 3-scale grain in terrain shader, aniso 16x on Moon StandardMaterials; hard sun 22deg az -20deg, no fog, ambient fill 0.05; black sky with stars, Earth phase-shaded; procedural only, no external download, no copyrighted image. vc179 Phase 4: sun elevation 12deg, Earth 1.9deg at az 200deg el 60deg, NASA Blue Marble Next Generation Earth texture (public domain, credit NASA) loaded in mars_world.gd _build_sky(); stars at brightness 0.3, labelled simulated (in Apollo photos bright ground hides stars); no wind, no ambient audio — the Moon is silent; no fog, horizon from far ground + curvature."
